    "| Optimizer | Langevin Dynamics (NO Adam) |\n",
    "| Dataset | TinyStories **5MB** (fast smoke test) |\n",
    "| d_model | 64 |\n",
    "| Layers | 2 |\n",
    "| Heads | 4 |\n",
    "| Seq len | 64 |\n",
    "| Epochs | 10 |\n",
    "| **Expected time** | ~3-5 min on T4 |"
   ]
